{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Bonsoir à tous ! Est Hinako !\nこんばんは皆さん！日奈子です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フランス語だよ(｡-∀-｡)\nかっこいいっしょ？(｡-∀-｡)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで\n2回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは\nざきーさんから頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はどんな冒頭あいさつが選ばれるのかなー？♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろんみなさんの中から、決めます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お楽しみに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/05/2753326/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/05/2753326/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぶっくぶくに\n空気はいっとるでー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/05/2753326/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の朝、放送された\n開運音楽堂さんのコーナーの1つである\n「となりの駅のみさ先輩」に\n純奈と出演させてもらいました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"開運音楽堂さんのスタジオ放送には"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4回出演させてもらってるんですが、\nとなりの駅のみさ先輩に出るのは\n初めてだったのでみさ先輩に\nお呼ばれされてとても嬉しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"杉山アナウンサーさんや\n美里さんにも\nいつかとなりの駅のみさ先輩に出てね～って言ってもらえてたので\n本当にうれしかったよー♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、となりの駅のみさ先輩や\n開運音楽堂におじゃましに行きたいな～٩(ˊᗜˋ*)و♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、今日BSで放送された\n集まれ！侍ジャパンみてくれましたかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の放送から、\n番組のエンディングが、\nサンクエトワールの「大人への近道」になっていました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー♡とても嬉しい♡\nありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういったきっかけをつくってくださり、ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人への近道が流れるたびに\n誰かの耳や心に届いて\nサンクエトワールが知れ渡ったら\nとても嬉しいな♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンクエトワール！\nこれからもたくさん活動していきたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/05/2753326/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/05/2753326/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/05/2753326/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても、短いけどきょうはこのへんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり、コーナーみたいな\nブログの中での企画みたいなものがあればいいなー！って書いてて思いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし！決めよう！\n何かブログ内での企画きめよう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/05/2753326/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あすかちんに今"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「パン界の中で何パンが一番好き？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていうメールをしたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「パン？パンはわりと幅広くすきよ！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていう返信がきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すきなソフトクリームの味も\nすきな野菜も\nすきな定食も\nいまだに決められない私と\n似てるよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無理やりこじつけてるけど、似てるよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優柔不断なの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、あすかちんいまは\nラーメンが食べたいんだね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし、いこう。ラーメン。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/05/2753326/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/05/2753326/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2014年 8月 19日\nに撮った写真。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まんまる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/05/2753326/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、おやすみなさーい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またかくねー！"}],"source":"archive"}